---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import '../styles/legacy.css';
// The application form below is the live site's markup, unchanged, so /application.js,
// /application-pdf.js and /api/submit.php keep working exactly as before. Only the styling is new.
---
<Base title="Apply" page="apply" legacy privacyLinkId="application-privacy-link" privacyTarget="application-privacy" bodyClass="apply-page" description="Apply to Markforth Solutions in Rawalpindi. A five-step application for agent, quality, operations, HR, administration and technical roles.">
  <PageHero
    label="Application"
    title="Bring your ambition."
    accent="Build with Markforth."
    lead="People make progress possible. Tell us about yourself and the role you want to grow into. Five guided steps, submitted directly to our recruitment team."
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Careers', href: '/careers.html' }, { label: 'Application' }]}
    action={{ label: 'Start the application', href: '#application-start' }}
    secondary={{ label: 'View open positions', href: '/careers.html' }}
    photo="workstation"
    badge={{ icon: 'file', title: '5 guided steps', text: 'Optional PDF CV, up to 5 MB' }}
  />
  <section class="container apply-shell" aria-label="Application form">
<div class="application-layout" id="application-start"><aside class="application-sidebar" aria-label="Application progress"><div class="sidebar-title">YOUR APPLICATION</div><div class="step-nav"><div class="step-indicator active" aria-current=step><span>01</span><b>Role & availability</b></div><div class="step-indicator " ><span>02</span><b>Personal details</b></div><div class="step-indicator " ><span>03</span><b>Experience</b></div><div class="step-indicator " ><span>04</span><b>Salary & reference</b></div><div class="step-indicator " ><span>05</span><b>Review & submit</b></div></div><div class="sidebar-visual"><div class="ring" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><circle class="ring__bg" cx="60" cy="60" r="52"/><circle class="ring__fg" cx="60" cy="60" r="52"/></svg><span class="ring__label"><b data-ring-pct>0%</b><small>complete</small></span></div><ul class="after-submit" aria-label="After you submit"><li><i></i>A confirmation number on screen</li><li><i></i>Review by our recruitment team</li><li><i></i>Status updates on your tracking page</li></ul></div><div class="sidebar-help"><p>Questions before you apply?<br>Our team is a message away.</p><a href="mailto:info@markforthsol.com">info@markforthsol.com ↗</a></div></aside><div><div class="application-tools"><span class="online-status" id="online-status"><i></i>Connecting securely…</span><label class="draft-toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="keep-draft"> Save draft in this tab</label></div><div class="draft-restored" id="draft-restored" hidden><span>Draft restored. Please reattach your CV and confirm the declaration.</span><button type="button" id="clear-draft">Clear saved draft ×</button></div><div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Application step" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuemax="5" aria-valuenow="1"><div class="progress-fill"></div></div><form id="application-form" class="app-form" enctype="multipart/form-data" method="post" novalidate><div class="form-trap" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this field empty<input name="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><section class="form-step" data-step="0" ><div class="form-step-heading"><span>STEP 01 / 05</span><h2 tabindex="-1">Position & availability</h2><p>Choose the role and campaign where you want to contribute. <a href="/careers.html">View available positions ↗</a></p></div><div class="fields-grid"><div class="role-selection full"><label for="position-select">Position applying for <span class="required">*</span><select id="position-select" name="position" required><option value="">Loading available positions…</option></select></label><p id="position-summary">Loading positions from the recruitment team.</p></div><label>Preferred campaign <span class="required">*</span><select name="campaign" required ><option value="">Select an option</option><option>Medicare</option><option>ACA</option><option>Final Expense</option><option>Auto Insurance</option><option>Hospital Indemnity</option><option>Home Improvement</option><option>Open to any campaign</option><option value="Not applicable / support role">Not applicable (support role)</option></select></label><label>Employment type <span class="required">*</span><select name="employment_type" required ><option value="">Select an option</option><option>Full-time</option><option>Part-time</option><option>Internship</option></select></label><label>Available to join <span class=required>*</span><input type="date" name="available_date" required placeholder="" maxlength="200" ></label><label>Can you work a US campaign / night shift? <span class="required">*</span><select name="night_shift" required ><option value="">Select an option</option><option>Yes</option><option>No</option><option>Would like to discuss</option></select></label></div></section><section class="form-step" data-step="1" hidden><div class="form-step-heading"><span>STEP 02 / 05</span><h2 tabindex="-1">Personal & contact details</h2><p>Tell us how to reach you and a little about your background.</p></div><div class="fields-grid"><label>Full name <span class=required>*</span><input type="text" name="full_name" required placeholder="As you use it professionally" maxlength="200" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Mobile / WhatsApp <span class=required>*</span><input type="tel" name="phone" required placeholder="e.g. 03XX XXXXXXX" maxlength="200" autocomplete="tel" minlength="10"></label><label>Alternate contact<input type="tel" name="alternate_phone"  placeholder="Optional" maxlength="200" ></label><label>Email address <span class=required>*</span><input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" maxlength="200" autocomplete="email"></label><label class="full">Current address <span class=required>*</span><textarea name="address" required placeholder="House / street / area" maxlength="3000" autocomplete="street-address"></textarea></label><label>City / area <span class=required>*</span><input type="text" name="city" required placeholder="e.g. Shamsabad, Rawalpindi" maxlength="200" autocomplete="address-level2"></label><label>Education / qualification <span class=required>*</span><input type="text" name="education" required placeholder="Highest qualification" maxlength="200" ></label><label>Languages you speak <span class=required>*</span><input type="text" name="languages" required placeholder="e.g. English, Urdu, Punjabi" maxlength="200" ></label><label>Spoken English self-assessment <span class="required">*</span><select name="english_level" required ><option value="">Select an option</option><option>Beginner</option><option>Intermediate</option><option>Good</option><option>Fluent</option></select></label></div></section><section class="form-step" data-step="2" hidden><div class="form-step-heading"><span>STEP 03 / 05</span><h2 tabindex="-1">Work experience</h2><p>Share your experience, skills, and strengths.</p></div><div class="fields-grid"><label>Experience level <span class="required">*</span><select name="experience_level" required id="experience-level"><option value="">Select an option</option><option>Fresher</option><option>Experienced</option></select></label><div class="full info-banner" id="fresher-note" hidden>New to BPO? You can apply as a fresher. Share your skills or relevant experience below.</div><div id="experienced-fields" class="full fields-grid" hidden><label>Total relevant experience <span class="required">*</span><input type="text" name="total_experience"  placeholder="e.g. 1 year 6 months" maxlength="200" data-experienced></label><label>Last employer <span class="required">*</span><input type="text" name="last_employer"  placeholder="Company name" maxlength="200" data-experienced></label><label>Previous job title <span class="required">*</span><input type="text" name="previous_title"  placeholder="Your last role" maxlength="200" data-experienced></label><label>Previous campaign / department <span class="required">*</span><input type="text" name="previous_campaign"  placeholder="Campaigns you worked on" maxlength="200" data-experienced></label><label class="full">Reason for leaving<textarea name="reason_leaving"  placeholder="A brief explanation" maxlength="3000" ></textarea></label></div><label class="full">Skills, strengths, and relevant experience <span class=required>*</span><textarea name="skills" required placeholder="Tell us about your communication, sales, customer service, or BPO skills." maxlength="3000" ></textarea></label><label class="full">Performance highlights or training<textarea name="highlights"  placeholder="Optional: relevant achievements, training, or certifications. Do not include consumer records or confidential employer information." maxlength="3000" ></textarea></label></div></section><section class="form-step" data-step="3" hidden><div class="form-step-heading"><span>STEP 04 / 05</span><h2 tabindex="-1">Compensation & reference</h2><p>Your expectations help us have a useful conversation.</p></div><div class="fields-grid"><label><span id="previous-salary-label">Previous monthly salary (PKR)</span><input type="number" name="previous_salary"  placeholder="For experienced applicants" maxlength="200" min="0" max="10000000" step="1"></label><label>Expected monthly salary (PKR) <span class=required>*</span><input type="number" name="expected_salary" required placeholder="Your expectation" maxlength="200" min="0" max="10000000" step="1"></label><label>Referred by (name)<input type="text" name="referred_by"  placeholder="Optional" maxlength="200" ></label><label>Reference contact<input type="tel" name="reference_contact"  placeholder="Optional, with their permission" maxlength="200" ></label><label>How did you hear about us? <span class="required">*</span><select name="source" required ><option value="">Select an option</option><option>Referral</option><option>Social media</option><option>Walk-in</option><option>Company website</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Other source / referral details<input type="text" name="source_details"  placeholder="Optional" maxlength="200" ></label><label class="full">Anything else we should know?<textarea name="additional"  placeholder="Optional: availability, travel considerations, or questions for the team." maxlength="3000" ></textarea></label><div class="full cv-area"><label for="cv-upload">Your CV <span class="optional">OPTIONAL</span></label><label class="cv-drop" for="cv-upload"><span class="upload-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↑</span><b>Choose or drop your CV</b><span>PDF only · Maximum 5 MB</span><input type="file" name="cv" id="cv-upload" accept=".pdf,application/pdf"></label><div id="cv-preview" role="status" hidden><span id="cv-file-name"></span><button type="button" id="remove-cv">Remove ×</button></div></div></div></section><section class="form-step" data-step="4" hidden><div class="form-step-heading"><span>STEP 05 / 05</span><h2 tabindex="-1">Review & submit</h2><p>Review your details, confirm the declaration, and submit directly to Markforth.</p></div><div class="fields-grid"><div id="application-review" class="full"></div><div class="declaration full"><h3>Applicant declaration</h3><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="declaration" required><span>I confirm that the information provided is accurate to the best of my knowledge. I understand that this application is subject to review and does not guarantee an interview or employment.</span></label><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="contact_consent" required><span>I agree that Markforth may use these details to review my application and contact me about recruitment.</span></label></div><label>Applicant signature (type your full name) <span class=required>*</span><input type="text" name="signature" required placeholder="Your full name" maxlength="200" ></label><label>Application date <span class=required>*</span><input type="date" name="application_date" required placeholder="" maxlength="200" readonly></label><div class="full info-banner" id="application-privacy"><b>Ready when you are.</b><br>Click Submit application to send your details and optional CV directly to Markforth. Your application is saved privately on our hosting. You will receive a confirmation number on this page. Recruitment questions: info@markforthsol.com.</div></div></section><p class="step-error" id="step-error" role="alert"></p><div class="form-navigation"><button type="button" id="previous-step" class="button button-secondary" hidden>← Back</button><span class="step-count" id="step-count">01 / 05</span><button type="button" id="next-step" class="button">Continue →</button></div><div class="send-options" id="send-options" hidden><button type="button" id="download-application" class="button button-secondary">Download branded PDF ↓</button><button type="button" id="print-application" class="button button-secondary">Open print preview ↗</button></div><div class="submit-progress" id="submit-progress" role="status" hidden><div><span id="submit-progress-label">Uploading your application…</span><b id="submit-percent">0%</b></div><div class="upload-track"><i></i></div><p>Please keep this page open while your application is saved.</p></div><section class="submit-panel" id="submit-panel" role="status" hidden><span class="success-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div class="eyebrow">APPLICATION RECEIVED</div><h3>Your next chapter starts here.</h3><p>Your application has been saved. Keep your confirmation number for any follow-up with our team.</p><div class="receipt"><span>YOUR CONFIRMATION NUMBER</span><strong id="application-reference"></strong><small id="application-timestamp"></small></div><p>Our team will review your application. Submission does not guarantee an interview or offer.</p><a class="button" id="track-application" href="/track.html">Track your application ↗</a><button type="button" class="button" id="receipt-pdf">Download your application PDF ↓</button></section><p class="draft-notice">Your application is sent only when you click Submit application. No email app required.</p></form><noscript><p>This guided form needs JavaScript. Please enable JavaScript to submit your application directly.</p></noscript></div></div>
  </section>
  <Fragment slot="end">
<dialog id="application-privacy-dialog"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h2>Application privacy</h2><p>Your application details and optional PDF CV are sent directly to Markforth when you click Submit application. They are stored privately on our hosting for recruitment review. Saving a draft in this browser tab is optional; CV files and consent choices are not included in the draft.</p><p>The team uses your information to review your application and contact you about recruitment. You can track published recruitment updates with your reference and an email verification code. Codes expire after 10 minutes; verified tracking access expires after 30 minutes. HR can send reviewed status messages to your application email. A session cookie protects the submission process. Contact <a href="mailto:info@markforthsol.com">info@markforthsol.com</a> with questions about your application or information.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-dark" id="close-application-privacy">Close</button></dialog>
    <script is:inline src="/assets/vendor/jspdf.umd.min.js"></script>
    <script is:inline src="/forms-api.js"></script>
    <script is:inline src="/application-pdf.js"></script>
    <script is:inline src="/application.js"></script>
  </Fragment>
</Base>
